          "summary": "Buildings cause nearly 40\\% of carbon emissions in the US. Of total building emissions, HVAC systems are responsible for approximately 40-60\\% and account for 15\\% of global energy consumption. Despite advances in artificial intelligence, most buildings still operate as inefficiently as they did decades ago. Building optimization, perhaps more so than any other optimization problem, has enormous potential for Machine Learning (ML) driven impact on climate change, in both the short and long term."
